  "evidence": [
    "Native source mappings and the pinned original define48 initial owner identities. Already mapped continuity placeholders remain recovery targets; source mapping alone does not establish implemented behavior. The additional seven subjects admit coupled existing Alpha/Net lifetimes/APIs and exact placement-delete402320 without resetting their historical obligations. Historical private censuses are starting evidence, not current implementation counts.",
    "Original constructors/destructors, vbtable/vtable transitions and allocator handoff establish true provider/session lists and embedded NetUnk72C. Shared4E3710 and4E38E0 remain enclosing-function span obligations, not independent new function identities. Actual VC6 emission/restoration must be measured before compiler-owned whole/scalar bindings are published.",
    "Independent original join review shows negative popup selection bypasses seek; cancellation must preserve callback-visible cursor and avoid abs on INT_MIN. Fifteen full original-vs-source cancellation cases and rejected unconditional-seek mutants support the reviewed proposal.",
    "Original setup4E3225 passes existing game.cpp LobbyAppGuid689218; export that existing object narrowly through game.h, preserve its control_game consumer and do not substitute equal-byte distinct NetLobbyAppGuid697548 or allocate another copy.",
    "DPLAY.H SDK callbacks and original argument/descriptor accesses support typed synchronous provider/session enumeration, unsigned GUID ordering and actual NetAllocationNode pointer APIs. Keep original allocation failure publication, callback re-reads and null-lobby reuse behavior.",
    "NetTextPayload/Entry observed roles do not prove unseen factory nominal types or complete extents. Preserve those discoveries. Net transport init/close/join_session remains separately unfinished; changing a declaration or keeping a build seam does not recover its behavior.",
    "Coordinator-reviewed manual integration only after fresh native compile/link, protected restoration, reference/layout/caller review and relevant regressions. No demotions, baseline resets, gate waivers, new unmeasured byte claims or automatic/game acceptance."
  ],
